674335271088191_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C7XEkOntmJEQ7kNvwEzHh5e&_nc_oc=Adp0ArzMPjvyk7A_IKPi9r1vb6__zSrlxlh5Pu60IXXafLPu5757cWIQvUdqDyzC_9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJKI93hsD11Paf6db19iBfMBNGA7RkveH0n6I5Ifnmggg&oe=6A9ECEFE"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1365002872273178", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_1365002875606511_680623144893069867_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8pZOg5A-E7wQ7kNvwF_ALNP&_nc_oc=Ado7FJYwhypP0AbLd6AH9DeFMIt2ZJAwCUjuyMvyoejXm5bBjx_njV5IwQDP_OqgmP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIAoezUaijSTbkLAVN3qYbVOkPf0sKje6HwzAL4uu9wDA&oe=6A9EB57A"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1345063124419869", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_1345063127753202_3114028335302026247_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=46YeHOa6m2kQ7kNvwHCgYGP&_nc_oc=AdpilBOzjwWClNpMrwDpXv1yintlMkosFARX_3p0-u-vzgfBsDwukgcmxu3YqUKgmGg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJvgOYwAp2oPqb0tiVdpNj82GQAB0u-tSKKFfE7waoEbw&oe=6A9ECEF4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1645920806494975", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_1645920809828308_4500634967897063640_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Z5PHB3uoZwQ7kNvwGywMEL&_nc_oc=AdrotR1QzApc-X9UAIJNTl93JXOtWPdGpeiz4gRn3IWi_nx-OfXDdZt50_x2Nr2tAuA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIXiZ7EqJ-aEK6lxihVhZlSlSVrJAQ81VZTGs0KhQFDYg&oe=6A9EDE3C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Shooter"], "long_description": "### Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise\n\nStep onto the red planet in **Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise**. Inspired by classic cabinet shooters, this game brings fast-paced, action-packed gameplay directly to VR. Survive the alien onslaught on an unforgiving Martian landscape.\n\n---\n\n#### Procedural Martian Terrain\nNo two battles are the same. Every deployment features an **automatically generated Martian terrain**, providing new tactical challenges, ridges, and vantage points to adapt to.\n\n#### Survive the Night\nTime is your enemy. Use the daytime to find your bearings, because when the sun sets, the real test begins. The night cycle **multiplies the alien horde**, sending aggressive waves from all directions. Survive as many nights as possible to set your high score.\n\n#### Tools for Survival\nTo stay alive against the overwhelming odds, master your movement and resources:\n\n* **Jetpack:** Gain the high ground, escape tight spots, and maneuver through valleys.\n* **Tactical Gear:** Use grenades to clear enemy clusters and health packs to recover.\n* **Supply Drops:** Watch the skies. Ammo replenishment drops from above when you need it most.\n\n---\n\nWhether you love retro shooters or want a challenging VR action game, *Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise* offers a focused and highly repeatable combat loop. Gear up and see how many nights you can survive.", "short_description": "Nostalgia meets VR! Dodge, weave, and blast through waves of hostile invaders in Arcade Shooter: Space Alien Sunrise. Experience classic shoot-'em-up mechanics revitalized for modern headsets. Grab your blasters, defend the galaxy, and claim your spot on the leaderboard."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mikalaikazei.github.io/ArcadeShooter.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mikalai Kazei", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mikalaikazei.github.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "e